{"v":4,"catch":"“THE TOWER OF DRUAGA”的續集終於來了！","desc":"《The Return of ISHTAR》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1986年發行的動作遊戲。\n故事發生在 DRUAGA 被推翻之後。 塔失去了DRUAGA的魔力，現在處於原來的廢墟中，怪物變得更加兇猛。 控制 KI 和 GIL 並嘗試逃離 THE TOWER OF DRUAGA，在那裡你甚至不再知道出路。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-09-22","genres":["動作","角色扮演","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dd43e307ce86662fe7d78ef421decb924016c6f49bb07c5e9d709165353f0b4f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f454bccbedf8a691ee7a82ac492553f6149d541c5ab28ee8d934c9605043eb9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6bf75a3c29209a2c54edd32fa2d9bf1d4fc3f571d621462d2d3db5b2f0bebcf1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/af143e0d240905f7f0aad8e1d7ec6f457337be635d81c69a30724c855b80a9ff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7cdc1b08def4ac4f081df82d509d4bb91ed5176fda67308ac2050f7de60b5489.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f2586080427e3561b3443ad96967f7f3eb7d00fc0642876a402319e38f9df0fe.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b32015ac2000","dlc":[]}